      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشوّش عَلَيْهِ الأَمْرُ</span></b>  <i>The affair,</i> or <i>state,</i> or
<i>case, became confused,</i> or <i>perplexed, to him:</i> (ElFárábee, S, Msb: mentioned in the S in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شيش</span>:) or this is post-classical: (Msb:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَوُّشٌ</span>
is a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَهَوُّشٌ</span>. (K.)

